| Original = filmed or produced by you. Third-party clips count only if you add something genuinely new (fresh information, analysis, a better storyline). Watching along, reacting, stitching clips, or narrating what is on screen without adding value is **unoriginal**. Borders, captions or speed changes on someone else's content are low-value edits. | Same | Your AI videos must show your own tests, screens and opinions. |
