**Warning about follower numbers.** Many blogs say you need 10,000 followers and 600,000 minutes watched in 60 days (or 5,000 followers and 60,000 minutes). These figures come from older program rules and third-party sites; Meta's current page says the program is invite-only and does not publish one fixed bar. Use them as a rough target, not a promise. Check your Professional Dashboard for your real status.

