## 4. Page setup checklist

- [ ] Create the Page (category: Digital creator, Education or Science and tech).
- [ ] Name: short, searchable, includes the topic (for example "AI Tips Daily").
- [ ] Profile picture (square, readable small) and cover image (about 820x312 on desktop; keep text in the center for mobile).
- [ ] Bio: who it is for, what they get, posting schedule, contact email.
- [ ] Add a call-to-action button (Sign up, Message, Learn more).
- [ ] Turn on two-factor authentication on every admin.
- [ ] Open Meta Business Suite and connect Instagram if you have it.
- [ ] Open Professional Dashboard > Monetization and check status or register interest.
- [ ] Create a Facebook Group or WhatsApp Channel for your community (optional but strong).
- [ ] Pin a welcome post that explains what you post and why to follow.

**Profile-in-Professional-Mode alternative:** Settings > Professional mode > Turn on. Then use the Professional Dashboard for the same steps.

