## 7. Video making

| Priority | Budget | Better |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Audio | Wired phone lav mic | USB mic or wireless kit |
| Light | Window or ring light | Softbox |
| Camera | Phone, vertical 9:16, 1080p+ | Mirrorless |
| Screen capture | Phone/PC built-in recorder | Recorder with cursor highlight |
| Stability | Phone tripod | Gimbal |

- Film vertical (9:16). Record screen demos in sharp resolution and zoom into the important part.
- Record the hook last-minute fresh, 2-3 takes; record B-roll of results.
- Quiet room, mic close, steady light, clean background.
- Faceless is possible (screen + voiceover), but the voice and the tests must be yours.
- Batch-record 5-7 Reels in one session.

