## 9. Thumbnails (cover images)

Reels get a cover. Choose it carefully; it shows on your Reels tab and in shares.

- Use one clear subject and 2-4 big words ("FREE AI TOOL").
- Bright subject, high contrast, face or tool result in view.
- Keep text in the center; check how it crops on the Page grid.
- Reuse colors and fonts so your Page looks consistent.
- Pick a frame from the video that shows the result, not a blurry mid-motion frame, or upload a custom cover.
- Do not mislead; the cover must match the video.

