## 10. Captions, descriptions and hashtags

**Caption template**
```
Line 1: hook (same promise as the video)
Line 2-3: what they will learn or get
Line 4: question to invite a real comment
Hashtags: 3-5
```

**Hashtags:** use 3-5: one broad (#reels or #facebookreels), one or two niche (#AItools #AIforbusiness), one branded. Hashtags are a weak categorization signal, so do not stuff 20-30. Test across your own Page rather than copying lists.

**Keywords:** put the topic words naturally in the first line, because people also use Facebook search.

**Links:** do not rely on links in every caption; some sources say Facebook may reduce reach for external-link posts, so test and use the pinned comment or Page button for links.

