## 11. Upload and scheduling

**Upload now:** Page > Create > Reel (or use Meta Business Suite > Create reel).

**Schedule in Meta Business Suite (desktop):** Content (or Planner) > Create reel > add video, cover, caption > Schedule > pick date and time. View or edit under Content > Posts & Reels > Scheduled. Reels scheduling is for professional accounts such as Pages and professional-mode profiles. Mobile app scheduling is also available.

**When to post:** open Meta Business Suite > Insights > Audience to see when your followers are active, and post near that time. Before you have data, test two slots for 3-4 weeks.

**Pace**

| Stage | Reels | Other posts |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Weeks 1-4 | 4-5 a week | 3 a week |
| Weeks 5-12 | 5-7 a week | 3-5 a week |
| Later | A pace you can keep without losing quality | Mix photo, text, Stories |

Content Monetization checks that you stay active, so avoid long gaps. Keep a buffer of 5 scheduled Reels.

