## 12. CTAs and community

Ask for **one** real action. Avoid engagement bait (begging for likes, shares, or "tag 3 friends to win"); Meta demotes manufactured engagement.

| Goal | CTA example |
| --- | --- |
| Comment | "Which AI tool should I test next?" |
| Follow | "Follow for one new AI workflow every day." |
| Save | "Save this for when you need it." |
| Share | "Send this to someone who writes reports." |
| Lead | "Comment PROMPT and I will send the full prompt." (reply personally, do not spam) |
| Community | "Join the free group for weekly AI templates." |

**Community habits:** reply to comments in the first hour; pin the best comment; answer questions with a follow-up Reel; run a weekly poll; credit followers whose questions inspire a video.

