## 13. How you actually earn

| Route | Notes |
| --- | --- |
| Facebook Content Monetization | Invite-only; pays on qualified views of Reels, Stories, photos, text. Express interest in Professional Dashboard. |
| Stars, subscriptions | Available when your Page/profile meets the feature's requirements and country. |
| Creator Fast Track | For creators who already have 100K+ followers elsewhere. |
| Brand collaborations | AI tool companies pay for honest reviews; disclose with the paid-partnership label. |
| Affiliate links | Meta has tested affiliate links on Reels with some retailers; also use tool affiliate programs; always disclose. |
| Your own products | Prompt packs, templates, mini-courses, automation services for local businesses. Often the biggest income for small Pages. |
| Lead generation | Move followers to a newsletter, WhatsApp channel or Group. |

Check that your country is eligible for monetization and payouts in the Professional Dashboard.

