## 16. Common mistakes to avoid

- Reposting AI news clips or other creators' videos with a logo or captions (unoriginal, deprioritized).
- Narrating what is already on screen without adding insight.
- Using a normal personal profile and expecting to earn.
- Buying followers, engagement pods, or bait posts.
- Fake AI content, fake celebrity endorsements or income promises.
- Posting with no strategy for 2 weeks and quitting.
- Ignoring Professional Dashboard warnings about originality or monetization.

